cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "lean-misc-math: miscellaneous mathematical results formalised in Lean 4"
message: >-
  If you use these results in your work, please cite this repository. Selection and
  curation of the results is the author's contribution; the Lean statements and proofs
  are machine-generated and machine-verified. See README.md.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Constantinides
    given-names: George
    alias: geoconuk
repository-code: "https://github.com/geoconuk/lean-misc-math"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 library of miscellaneous classical and other mathematical results built on
  Mathlib. The choice of which results to formalise, how they should be stated, and
  which are worth publishing is the author's contribution. The Lean statements and
  their proofs are generated by Claude and are not reviewed by a human; they are
  checked by Lean's kernel and audited so that every declaration depends only on
  propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formalised mathematics
  - interactive theorem proving
  - machine-generated proofs
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-08"
